Conclusion

The five dashboards provide a consolidated view of banking operations, transaction activity, account exposure, and financial risk.

- Executive Risk Analysis – Delivers an overall view of transaction performance and key risk indicators.
- Account Exposure Analysis – Highlights account balances, dormant accounts, and potential financial exposure.
- Transaction History – Enables detailed examination of transaction patterns and customer activity.
- Branch Risk Distribution – Identifies high-risk branches and regional variations in risk.
- Transaction Trend Analysis – Tracks transaction behaviour, value trends, and credit-debit movement.

Overall, the solution transforms raw banking data into actionable insights, enabling better risk monitoring, informed decision-making, and proactive identification of potential fraudulent activities.

Consistent data preparation and metric definitions across Power BI, Tableau, and Qlik Sense also ensure comparable and reliable insights across all three platforms.
